>(<!-- -->2%–5.75%<!-- -->)</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm hover:bg-accent/50 transition-colors\" href=\"/north-carolina-tax-calculator\">North Carolina<span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->4.5%<!-- -->)</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm hover:bg-accent/50 transition-colors\" href=\"/pennsylvania-tax-calculator\">Pennsylvania<span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->3.07%<!-- -->)</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm hover:bg-accent/50 transition-colors\" href=\"/ohio-tax-calculator\">Ohio<span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->0%–3.99%<!-- -->)</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm hover:bg-accent/50 transition-colors\" href=\"/michigan-tax-calculator\">Michigan<span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->4.25%<!-- -->)</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm hover:bg-accent/50 transition-colors\" href=\"/new-jersey-tax-calculator\">New Jersey<span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->1.4%–10.75%<!-- -->)</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm hover:bg-accent/50 transition-colors\" href=\"/colorado-tax-calculator\">Colorado<span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->4.4%<!-- -->)</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm hover:bg-accent/50 transition-colors\" href=\"/arizona-tax-calculator\">Arizona<span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->2.5%<!-- -->)</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm hover:bg-accent/50 tran