 & 9% Surtax\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Free Massachusetts tax calculator 2026. Take-home pay after 5% flat tax and 9% surtax over $1M. No sign-up.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"free Massachusetts tax calculator,Massachusetts tax calculator,MA paycheck calculator,Massachusetts income tax,Massachusetts 5% tax,Massachusetts 9% surtax,Massachusetts take home pay,Massachusetts salary calculator,MA flat tax rate,free tax calculator for 2026,MA state tax 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"publisher\",\"content\":\"TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"category\",\"content\":\"finance\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"classification\",\"content\":\"Tax Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"10\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/massachusetts-tax-calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"google-site-verification\",\"content\":\"verify_google_site_verification_token\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Massachusetts Tax Calculator 2026 — 5% Flat & 9% Surtax\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Free Massachusetts tax calculator. Take-home pay after 5% flat state tax and 9% surtax over $1M. No sign-up. 2026 data.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/massachusetts-tax-calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"property\":\"og:site_name\",\"content\":\"TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"property\":\"og:locale\",\"content\":\"en_US\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"property\":\"o